Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Usagi Drop 6.5 [TL-ZeroYuki]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{02:01 Osu News}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{04:38 Full Bloom in the Sky}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks just like snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.67,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The cherry blossoms this year will be wilting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:50.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow is a holiday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:51.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,so let's go flower-viewing together. {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanami}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:53.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.99,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:58.08,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Should I make lunch boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:58.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:00:59.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:01.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:01.41,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yay~!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:03.41,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:09.79,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry for deciding so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:10.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:13.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We have nothing to do tomorrow, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:15.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What should I bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.84,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:27.52,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki is always causing trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.77,0:01:30.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:33.58,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's meet at the park tomorrow at 8 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.65,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,How about 9 AM then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:45.12,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Flower viewing only begins around lunch time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:46.23,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.58,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What about 10 AM...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,But I have to watch Gransazers...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:53.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it has to be in the afternoon then.
