Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:05.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the pail, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:07.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It should be under the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:09.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, right.{Oh, yeah.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It might rain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:15.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's called a Spring Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:19.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's already raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:28.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad.{Bad!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's raining rather heavily too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make teruterubozu. {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teruterubozu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:05.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The rain stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:07.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:10.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The teruterubozu saved us.{Fortunately, we made the teruterubozu.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:20.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hope they didn't fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:30.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the smell of leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:41.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All the blossoms are gone! {flower}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.92,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey~!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,200)}It's a full bloom in the sky.
